1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:01,400
Now are you
ready to begin

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,269
our Ultimate
Friendship Week?

3
00:00:03,269 --> 00:00:05,204
First, I thought we could
draw some pictures

4
00:00:05,204 --> 00:00:06,706
with these new markers
I got --

5
00:00:06,706 --> 00:00:08,207
neon 12-pack.

6
00:00:08,207 --> 00:00:10,543
Eh, I kind of already drew
pictures today with Chelsea.

7
00:00:10,543 --> 00:00:13,946
She has glitter neon markers --
a 24-pack.

8
00:00:13,946 --> 00:00:15,548
[ Slot-machine noises ]

9
00:00:13,946 --> 00:00:15,548
Whoa.

10
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:17,951
Wait a minute.
Who's Chelsea?

11
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:19,085
I met her in class.

12
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:21,187
Oh, man.
She's so cool and funny.

13
00:00:21,187 --> 00:00:22,421
Um, okay.

14
00:00:22,421 --> 00:00:24,090
Well, let's do
something else, then.

15
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:25,091
Roller skating.

16
00:00:25,091 --> 00:00:26,526
Yeah!
I love roller skating.

17
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:28,728
Chelsea and I were skating
around the halls all day.

18
00:00:28,728 --> 00:00:31,096
She wears these shoes with
little wheels in the heel.

19
00:00:31,096 --> 00:00:32,364
It's just so cute.

20
00:00:32,364 --> 00:00:34,601
You drew pictures
and roller skated...

21
00:00:34,601 --> 00:00:36,069
without<i> me?</i>

22
00:00:36,069 --> 00:00:38,238
Yeah, we did.
You should have been there.

23
00:00:38,238 --> 00:00:40,573
[ Cellphone chirps ]

24
00:00:40,573 --> 00:00:42,374
Ooh, I got to take this.
It's Chelsea.

25
00:00:42,374 --> 00:00:44,109
Yo, Chells Bells.
What is up?

26
00:00:44,109 --> 00:00:46,045
[ Indistinct chatter
through cellphone ]

27
00:00:44,109 --> 00:00:46,045
No, I'm totally free.

28
00:00:46,045 --> 00:00:47,246
I'll catch up
with you guys later.

29
00:00:47,246 --> 00:00:48,380
I'm just gonna go
grab a scoop

30
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:49,481
at Penguin Pete's
with Chelsea.

31
00:00:49,481 --> 00:00:51,250
That cool?
Girl, I know it!

32
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:53,386
Ha ha!
You are so cute.

33
00:00:53,386 --> 00:00:55,722
[ Shakily ] Uh...yeah.

34
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:57,089
Totally cool.

35
00:00:57,089 --> 00:00:57,624
[ Bubbling ]

